  "answer": "This general file converter / change-file-type request has been filed several times before. Past tickets say the feature is not planned as a single 'convert anything to anything' tool: changing a file's extension does not actually convert its contents (e.g. renaming a zip to exe or msi does not make it one, and DOC to PDF needs real conversion logic), and a universal converter crosses too many formats with data-loss, compression and licensing issues. Maintainers pointed to the tracking issues for specific cases (image conversion #2686, audio/video conversion #3442, and the general file converter duplicate #9743) where you can add a thumbs-up or context. In the meantime, use the app that handles the format, for example Word's 'Save as PDF' or the Photos app's save-as options, or a dedicated converter tool. Simply renaming the extension only changes the name, not the file's format."
